ide it.", "words": [{"w": "All", "s": 945, "e": 950}, {"w": "3:", "s": 951, "e": 958}, {"w": "about", "s": 969, "e": 977}, {"w": "20", "s": 980, "e": 987}, {"w": "dollars.", "s": 989, "e": 1003}, {"w": "Price", "s": 1013, "e": 1019}, {"w": "can't", "s": 1021, "e": 1026}, {"w": "decide", "s": 1027, "e": 1039}, {"w": "it.", "s": 1040, "e": 1045}]}, {"start": 1062, "end": 1211, "text": "Two: which fit someone who writes product pages and builds small tools, on 20 euros?", "words": [{"w": "Two:", "s": 1062, "e": 1070}, {"w": "which", "s": 1082, "e": 1087}, {"w": "fit", "s": 1089, "e": 1094}, {"w": "someone", "s": 1096, "e": 1103}, {"w": "who", "s": 1104, "e": 1107}, {"w": "writes", "s": 1108, "e": 1115}, {"w": "product", "s": 1118, "e": 1127}, {"w": "pages", "s": 1129, "e": 1141}, {"w": "and", "s": 1142, "e": 1145}, {"w": "builds", "s": 1147, "e": 1155}, {"w": "small", "s": 1157, "e": 1164}, {"w": "tools,", "s": 1166, "e": 1178}, {"w": "on", "s": 1186, "e": 1190}, {"w": "20", "s": 1191, "e": 1198}, {"w": "euros?", "s": 1199, "e": 1211}]}, {"start": 1225, "end": 1256, "text": "It cut Gemini.", "words": [{"w": "It", "s": 1225, "e": 1229}, {"w": "cut", "s": 1232, "e": 1238}, {"w": "Gemini.", "s": 1241, "e": 1256}]}, {"start": 1273, "end": 1342, "text": "Three: which one first, and why?", "words": [{"w": "Three:", "s": 1273, "e": 1282}, {"w": "which", "s": 1294, "e": 1298}, {"w": "one", "s": 1300, "e": 1304}, {"w": "first,", "s": 1309, "e": 1320}, {"w": "and", "s": 1329, "e": 1332}, {"w": "why?", "s": 1334, "e": 1342}]}, {"start": 1357, "end": 1475, "text": "ChatGPT Plus. Keep the other two free, and use them as reviewers.", "words": [{"w": "ChatGPT", "s": 1357, "e": 1379}, {"w": "Plus.", "s": 1383, "e": 1394}, {"w": "Keep", "s": 1405, "e": 1409}, {"w": "the", "s": 1410, "e": 1412}, {"w": "other", "s": 1414, "e": 1418}, {"w": "two", "s": 1420, "e": 1424}, {"w": "free,", "s": 1427, "e": 1434}, {"w": "and", "s": 1439, "e": 1445}, {"w": "use", "s": 1447, "e": 1451}, {"w": "them", "s": 1452, "e": 1455}, {"w": "as", "s": 1456, "e": 1459}, {"w": "reviewers.", "s": 1460, "e": 1475}]}, {"start": 1493, "end": 1618, "text": "Yes, ChatGPT picked itself. A minute earlier it picked Claude.", "words": [{"w": "Yes,", "s": 1493, "e": 1502}, {"w": "ChatGPT", "s": 1512, "e": 1534}, {"w": "picked", "s": 1538, "e": 1543}, {"w": "itself.", "s": 1544, "e": 1559}, {"w": "A", "s": 1569, "e": 1571}, {"w": "minute", "s": 1572, "e": 1579}, {"w": "earlier", "s": 1580, "e": 1593}, {"w": "it", "s": 1594, "e": 1598}, {"w": "picked", "s": 1599, "e": 1604}, {"w": "Claude.", "s": 1607, "e": 1618}]}, {"start": 1634, "end": 1748, "text": "And it said when to switch: if I mostly build software, Claude Pro.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 1634, "e": 1636}, {"w": "it", "s": 1637, "e": 1640}, {"w": "said", "s": 1642, "e": 1648}, {"w": "when", "s": 1649, "e": 1654}, {"w": "to", "s": 1655, "e": 1658}, {"w": "switch:", "s": 1661, "e": 1670}, {"w": "if", "s": 1682, "e": 1685}, {"w": "I", "s": 1687, "e": 1689}, {"w": "mostly", "s": 1690, "e": 1699}, {"w": "build", "s": 1700, "e": 1706}, {"w": "software,", "s": 1708, "e": 1722}, {"w": "Claude", "s": 1731, "e": 1738}, {"w": "Pro.", "s": 1740, "e": 1748}]}, {"start": 1765, "end": 1826, "text": "That's its pick. The call is mine.", "words": [{"w": "That's", "s": 1765, "e": 1774}, {"w": "its", "s": 1777, "e": 1783}, {"w": "pick.", "s": 1784, "e": 1790}, {"w": "The", "s": 1798, "e": 1801}, {"w": "call", "s": 1802, "e": 1809}, {"w": "is", "s": 1811, "e": 1814}, {"w": "mine.", "s": 1817, "e": 1826}]}, {"start": 1846, "end": 1906, "text": "DM me NARROW for the three prompts.", "words": [{"w": "DM", "s": 1846, "e": 1855}, {"w": "me", "s": 1856, "e": 1860}, {"w": "NARROW", "s": 1862, "e": 1874}, {"w": "for", "s": 1877, "e": 1880}, {"w": "the", "s": 1882, "e": 1884}, {"w": "three", "s": 1885, "e": 1891}, {"w": "prompts.", "s": 1894, "e": 1906}]}, {"start": 1921, "end": 1997, "text": "Run them before you pay for 3 AI tools.", "words": [{"w": "